# Warp models

When Warp, Shuttle, or Reed is running a coding step, use the model in `.warp/config.yaml`.

Default: `grok-4.7-high` (Grok 4.7 High). Use that slug exactly. Do not substitute a fast variant, and do not fall back to another family if the slug is missing: stop and ask. A value in `.warp/config.yaml` overrides this default. Judgment and notification steps may use a cheaper model; coding and Bugbot-fix loops may not.
